  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "A more manageable coastal development opportunity in the heart of Murrays Bay, combining school zoning, sea views and a substantial consent pathway already undertaken.\r\n\r\n489 & 491 East Coast Road offer approximately 2,230sqm of land with plans for 10 four-bedroom townhouses, including a mix of single and double internal-access garage layouts. Resource Consent, Building Consent and EPA approval were previously granted, subject to council extension.\r\n\r\nFor developers seeking a smaller, more controlled North Shore project in the current market, this opportunity provides a clear starting point while still allowing room to review, update and optimise the scheme.\r\n\r\n* Approx. 2,230sqm in sought-after Murrays Bay\r\n* Premium school-zone location\r\n* Approx. 7-minute walk to Rangitoto College\r\n* Elevated site with attractive sea views\r\n* Approved plans for 10 four-bedroom townhouses\r\n* Mix of single and double internal-access garage layouts\r\n* RC, BC and EPA previously granted, subject to council extension\r\n* Smaller project scale suited to current developer risk appetite\r\n\r\nContact Ray on 022 158 3320 today to request a comprehensive information pack or to arrange a private site inspection.",
